body:
@gongpha Thanks for your suggestions. I implemented all of them except for this one:

> data using void* instead of the container like TightLocalVector

I'm not sure about the semantics of containers like `TightLocalVector`, is it necessary to use it here?

@DeeJayLSP Thanks, I changed it to use `TightLocalVector`. Although I did encounter two problems:
1. There seems to be a bug in `AudioStreamMP3`, because `AudioStreamMP3::clear_data()` clears `data` but doesn't set `data_len` to 0 (although this bug is unlikely to matter).
2. You suggested to remove the empty constructor from `AudioStreamOpus`, but `AudioStreamMP3` has an empty constructor - should that be removed as well?
